    "steps": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "description": "- Make sure to Save and use a Tent, if needed, at the Save Point near the bar.\n- When you're ready, enter the bar and approach the owner.\n- Watch the scene, and you'll eventually gain control of **Alice**.",
        "type": "story",
        "rewards": []
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "description": "As **Alice**, enter the women's restroom, then check both stalls and the mirror. Repeat this again, and then a third time to trigger a battle with Olga.",
