            {
              "name": "Olga",
              "hp": 680,
              "class": "Dark",
              "drop": "Monk Earrings"
            }
          ],
          "party": [],
          "exp": 15000,
          "cash": 13000,
          "strategy": "- Olga will use normal attacks, Blaze, Rock Storm, Nova, Icy Breath, and Lightning to do decent damage each round, maybe 50-60 HP of damage every round.\n- Watch out if she uses Mind Assault to steal your MP, as you'll want to recover it immediately if she takes too much.\n- Cast Blessed Light rounds one and two, then Cure the next if needed.\n- Blessed Light two rounds, Cure the third.\n- Lather, rinse, repeat.\n- Oh, and don't forget to recover your SP if needed.\n- Not much else you can do since it's just **Alice**."
